  "kind": "phrase",
  "headword": "at present",
  "star": true,
  "senses": [
    {
      "zh": "现在，目前"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "More and more foreigners are living and working in Shanghai "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "at present"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "目前越来越多的外国人在上海生活和工作。"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "at present 是常考词组，常出现在保持句意基本不变的句型转换练习中，所以学生一定要知道：at present 与 for the time being 或 now 意思相同，在句中可以互换。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：You can leave your suitcase "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "at present"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= You can leave your suitcase "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "for the time being"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "Now"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ", you can leave your suitcase."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "现在你可以放下你的手提箱。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
